{"id":"vod_lz_790","vodId":"790","provider":"lz","providerName":"量子资源","type":2,"name":"无彩限的怪灵世界","name_cn":"无彩限的怪灵世界","date":"2016-01-01","year":"2016","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"全集","images":{"common":"https://img.lzipic.com/upload/vod/20220323-1/a291c19d8eac54615b42c22490743717.jpg"},"summary":"在这个世界上，存在着一种名为“怪灵”的生物。故事发生在弗塞亚学院之中，在那里，设立了名为“脑机能异常对策室”的机构，专门解决怪灵带来的危险和麻烦。一条晴彦（下野紘 配音）是一年级新生，亦是对策室的成员，他拥有能够使用绘画封印怪灵的能力，是足智多谋的军师。                                                                     　　川神舞（上坂堇 配音）是一条晴彦的学姐，个性开朗行事冲动的她常常惹出不少的麻烦，和晴彦组成了搭档相互取长补短居然格外的般配。除此之外，温文尔雅的千金大小姐和泉玲奈（早见沙织 配音），特立独行的孤高展示水无濑小系（内田真礼 配音），这些孩子们集结在一起，为了保护他们挚爱的朋友和家园向怪灵发起了宣战。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2022-03-25 16:24:55","playable":true,"episodeCount":14,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"lzm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"01集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/1_c5a90456/index.m3u8"},{"name":"02集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220323/14_00a42b09/index.m3u8"},{"name":"03集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/2_7054a177/index.m3u8"},{"name":"04集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/3_9851f1a9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"05集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/4_97301463/index.m3u8"},{"name":"06集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/5_a2a2523c/index.m3u8"},{"name":"07集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/6_bf59ae46/index.m3u8"},{"name":"08集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/7_4df6dd61/index.m3u8"},{"name":"09集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/8_e2c603f6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"10集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/9_d654769d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"11集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/10_80b11b90/index.m3u8"},{"name":"12集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/11_895571d7/index.m3u8"},{"name":"13集","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/12_5ff04d16/index.m3u8"},{"name":"番外編","url":"https://vip1.lz-cdn5.com/20220322/13_362f1145/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt